[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `tests/common/mod.rs` | `dlopen`/`dlsym` of both `.so`s, ABI mirrors of the C structs, bit-exact comparators, seeded PRNG, pathological-value pool, polygon builders |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `tests/phase_b_vector.rs` | CONFIGS rows 1-20 (scalar / vector / transform layer) |
