[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m segfaults. Documented as `ERRORS.md` row 50.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    115[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `c2Poly.count > 8` is tested **only** through a shared oversized backing buffer
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    116[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`CONFIGS.md` row 56), because the C reads past the declared arrays. Handing
