[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    118[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and produce meaningless failures.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    119[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    120[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Harness self-check (mutation testing)
